    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報220期"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEik2nVwjQp4_E-1RfMYS2j5myKSFLc2UQ7WA7XgJgXElH8JHbQIOl_GvbHGc60aMeeQ-_5iL6-NBwLyqgRK2BF8oh_eT6y1ptETo7A2NPfBmugTXevxMUjGTr7raMlysPYMzAKD_ZYg8DQE/s1600/220.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEik2nVwjQp4_E-1RfMYS2j5myKSFLc2UQ7WA7XgJgXElH8JHbQIOl_GvbHGc60aMeeQ-_5iL6-NBwLyqgRK2BF8oh_eT6y1ptETo7A2NPfBmugTXevxMUjGTr7raMlysPYMzAKD_ZYg8DQE/s1600/220.jpg\" width=\"470\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n\n\n<p><b><span style=\"color: red;\">220期</span><span style=\"color: red;\">目</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: red;\">錄&nbsp;</span></b></p><br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">做伙來唸詩</span><br /><span style=\"color: blue;\"><br /></span>吳春金/感謝<br /><br />洪錦田/葉仔原本生tī樹欉頂<br /><br />唐秉輝/失去一隻羊ê詩<br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">台文青年</span><br /><span style=\"color: blue;\"><br /></span>Kang Chí-gîm/時間<br /><br />劉宜云/白熊ê願望<br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">基金會15周年</span><br /><span style=\"color: blue;\"><br /></span><a href=\"http://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/09/blog-post.html\" target=\"_blank\">何信翰/李江却基金會十五週年、台文通訊二十週年賀詞</a><br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">花埕照日</span><br /><span style=\"color: blue;\"><br /></span><a href=\"http://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/09/blog-post_1.html\" target=\"_blank\">王昭華/黏阿媽</a><br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">Bàng-gah：三个女生楊桃湯</span><br /><br />陳義仁/<br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">台羅會交流道</span><br /><span style=\"color: blue;\"><br /></span>Hok &nbsp;Chû Tiuⁿ /Siàu念金大友 (Darrell Jenks)<br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">光景bóng uē</span><br /><span style=\"color: blue;\"><br /></span>Tan,Uichi /來去香港（四）─ 食bē siān ê香港<br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">咱來講看māi</span><br /><span style=\"color: blue;\"><br /></span><a href=\"http://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/09/e_1.html\" target=\"_blank\">王貞文/威權無法度消滅ê聲</a><br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">逐家來phó-tāu</span><br /><span style=\"color: blue;\"><br /></span><a href=\"http://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/08/blog-post_26.html\" target=\"_blank\">江澄樹/來去日月潭</a><br /><br />陳榮廷/揣台灣詩路，tuè台灣詩行<br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">台灣人寫真</span><br /><span style=\"color: blue;\"><br /></span>李文正/寫hō͘我上懷念ê杜代書<br /><br />潘科元/Hit工tī金剛寺山門邊<br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">Siraya批信</span><br /><span style=\"color: blue;\"><br /></span>Pais Abiki Ngá-î/Kapulong 仙姑祖千秋日(四)<br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">Saⁿ-kap讀小說</span><br /><br />邱偉欣/事變（二）<br /><br />施俊州/Hibálih姑娘（五）<br /><br />黃文宏/白色ê山嶺（二）－－願冤靈早日得著安歇<br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">七字仔評</span><br /><br />洪健斌/戒嚴生民主<br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffe599; color: blue;\">2011阿却賞</span><br /><br />李淑貞/Suí人無suí命（二）"
  },
